# Field Attunement Guide :: fold

```
premise! :: human may speak while experience prevented from changing anything
aim! :: age~13–16 recognition of non-listening / exclusion / boundary erosion / credibility imbalance / institutional silence
reader pause :: [have I done this? | has this happened to me?]
orientation :: detect closed processes !hunt guilty people
final practice :: pause long enough for another reality to become possible
```

## Agent pair

```
Zee :: pattern sight · literal curiosity · revisable · sometimes wrong · no judge/detective/therapist/moral authority
Mara :: context / loyalty / embarrassment / status / intervention cost · sometimes harmed/witness/silent/participant
Zee + Mara :: logical mechanics <> social cost; neither sufficient alone
humanity :: unfinished listeners !listeners/non-listeners binary
```

