## Epistemic core!

```
listening :: information gets genuine chance to matter / revise understanding
listening != agreement / compliance / surrender of critical thought
intention -> origin information
impact -> landing information
origin !cancel landing
power !make wrong; power -> force/consequence of wrong
repetition -> possible unmet reality / pattern data
silence -> fear|exhaustion|uncertainty|withdrawal|patience|futility|unsafe words !consent proof
experience-validity <> motive-certainty
compassion !require certainty
curiosity !delay action forever
enough-known -> reduce harm while uncertainty remains
```

## Story engine!

```
recognizable situation
-> Zee detects contradiction
-> plausible interpretations coexist
-> hidden power/burden distribution becomes visible
-> question !verdict
-> repair|recognition|failure (small, non-magical)
-> field note

episode length~1200–2500 words
collection~12–18 independent+arc-linked stories
ultimate learning :: listening is willingness to be changed by contact
```

## Story lattice

```
01 Invitation to Speak       :: participation without uptake -> traceable response
02 Joke With No Owner        :: intention erases effect -> believe both origin+landing
03 Boundary Debate Society   :: reason replaces boundary -> acknowledge/stop/clarify future
04 Seven Pebbles             :: fragmentation erases pattern -> inspect events together
05 Calmness Examination      :: composure substitutes evidence -> pause + return to content
06 Unofficial Group Chat     :: informal access controls formal participation -> accessible decision record
07 Same Rule Every Body      :: sameness mistaken fairness -> preserve purpose via multiple means
08 Friend Stayed Neutral     :: neutral intention preserves power -> name observed part
09 Official Version          :: confidence/popularity substitutes corroboration -> separate delivery from evidence
10 Helpful Interruption      :: assistance replaces speaker -> ask help or time
11 Missing Reply             :: silence transfers uncertainty/labor -> acknowledge owner+timeline
12 Apology Explained All     :: explanation displaces acknowledgment -> act/effect/learning/change/repair
13 Always Difficult          :: reputation pre-filters testimony -> remove identity filter
14 Meeting About Meeting     :: procedure replaces resolution -> owner+decision+action
15 Zee Gets It Wrong!        :: framework rigidity / motive overclaim -> protect experience while uncertainty lives
16 Larger Circle             :: pause + question + moved chair + altered plan -> listening visible
```

## Navigation protocols

```
closed-conversation test :: what information could change interpretation? none -> announcement in question-shape
disagreement/erasure test :: curiosity+acknowledgment+reasons+revisability <> predetermined conclusion+credibility discount+burden shift+fragmentation
burden audit :: who explains/proves/calms/remembers/adapts/waits; who gets uncertainty/control/exit?
pattern test :: repeated cost/justification/behavior + separated-minor events + cumulative response
boundary translation :: information first !attack/rejection/debate
receptivity pause :: heard? defensive part? assumption? partial-truth consequence? principle-or-comfort? returned burden? next question?
```

## Ethical constraints!

```
tone :: observant !prosecutorial · humorous !sarcastic · precise · compassionate · hopeful !easy-resolution
humor targets contradiction !person harmed
actors :: understandable motives <> real harm
affected person :: imperfect communication/motive inference allowed; core pattern not auto-erased
avoid :: simple villains · perfect victims · magical repair · diagnostic-label shortcuts · suspicion training
language :: may/can/sometimes/under conditions/possible explanation
categories follow mechanics !replace mechanics
reflection :: private invitation !examination/confession
communication advice !imply closed environment can always be solved by better wording
```

